{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1211423001:0":{"text":"난 아무 말도 안 할 거니까 일찌감치 포기해!","source_cn":"我什么都不会说！你们趁早放弃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370464CFBDE60B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211423002:0":{"text":"그럴 줄 알았어.\n너의 그 멍청한 모습을 보니, 선원들끼리 모여서 전술을 논의할 때 넌 안 부를 것 같네.","source_cn":"我猜也是。\\n看你这傻大个的模样，船员聚在一起讨论战术...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDBD550CBC7ED19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211423003:1":{"text":"헛소리! 나도 알고 있어! 그래도 난 충성심이 강하니, 말 안 할 거야!","source_cn":"胡说！我知道！但我忠诚，我不说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C4E2F2D7EF9901B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211423004:1":{"text":"그냥 아무것도 모른다고 인정해. 비웃지 않을 테니까.","source_cn":"说不出来就承认嘛，我又不会笑你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5B4CA172CB4DD99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211423005:1":{"text":"배 한 척에 존재감 없는 녀석 한두 명쯤은 있는 법이니까. 괜찮아, 그건 창피한 게 아니야.","source_cn":"一艘船上总有那么几个不被重视的边缘人物，没事，不丢人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162FFD330C6A91F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211423006:1":{"text":"아니... 아니야! 나도 알아! 나도 작전 회의에 참여했었다고!","source_cn":"不……不！我知道！我参与了作战会议！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFA98E4ADDF5641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211423007:1":{"text":"어휴, 그걸 누가 믿겠어. 넌 그냥 폭약이나 옮기는 일꾼이잖아?","source_cn":"哎哟，谁信呐。你不就是个搬炸药的苦力么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60E387E743194D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211423008:1":{"text":"아니거든! 선장님이 나더러 연금술사를 보호하라고 했어! 이게 얼마나 중요한 일인데!","source_cn":"我不是！船长派我在这里保护炼金术师！我的工作很重要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA444FC37BD3D3F42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211423009:1":{"text":"그런 말은 나도 지어낼 수 있어. 그렇게 따지면 난 호드킨이 러스트 항에 심어놓은 스파이야.","source_cn":"这话我也能编，我还说我是霍德希金安插在锈锚港的间谍呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x567FAFD637F6D2AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211423010:1":{"text":"거짓말 아니야! 선장은 그 연금술사를 엄청나게 아껴! 그 연금술사만 열 수 있는 문이 있거든!","source_cn":"我没有骗你！船长很重视那名炼金术师！因为有些门只有他才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB262AC3F4FFA8091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211423011:1":{"text":"으흠, 꽤 괜찮은 정보네. 고마워, 문어 머리 형씨.","source_cn":"嗯哼，不错的情报。谢啦，章鱼头老哥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF284C2721096F3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211423012:1":{"text":"이제, 푹 자도 돼.","source_cn":"现在，你可以好好睡一觉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389BE89E31BEDA82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211423013:0":{"text":"으악...!","source_cn":"啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B60233400120F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1211423017:0":{"text":"신밧드는 재빨리 상대방을 기절시켰다...","source_cn":"辛巴达利落地打晕了对方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x570187B378F7519F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211423014:1":{"text":"신밧드, 좀 하는데?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你倒是有一套。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x967E1CD85F251B53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211423015:1":{"text":"이 정도쯤이야. 기본 중의 기본이지.","source_cn":"不值一提，基础中的基础。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C956C2C6D112DBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211423016:1":{"text":"자, 이제 이 멍청이가 말한 연금술사를 찾으러 가보자.","source_cn":"好了，我们去找找这傻瓜说的炼金术师吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD803EBAA78FF7A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的死潮劳工":{"text":"죽음의 함대 일꾼","source":"愤怒的死潮劳工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":4}}